## Design Decisions

- **Compressor:** ON at boot, OFF during night mode, ON at morning. No cooldown. Shop compressor with own pressure switch.
- **Relay mapping:** Position-based (1-4), function-per-position with dropdowns, unique validation client + server.
- **Alerts:** Bitmask-based, sent on state change, reads existing safety flags via accessor functions.
- **Weather:** HTTP only, 3s timeout, configurable lat/lon, explicit emoji ranges, stale detection at 60min.
- **Override timeout:** Configurable 1-1440min, persisted to RuntimeCache, server-validated, quick-select buttons.
- **Graph dashboard:** 350 points max, 8KB heap, 5s live feed, Chart.js from SPIFFS.
- **Tap-to-override:** Double-tap confirmation with 5-min cooldown, toast feedback, relay names from DOM.
